.el .ds Aq '
.TH impact 1  "impact " 
.SH NAME
impact \- Analyze consequences of changing an element
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBimpact\fR [\fB\-\-max\-depth\fR] [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIELEMENT_ID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Analyze consequences of changing an element
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH INSPECTION
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-depth\fR \fI<MAX_DEPTH>\fR
Limit impact propagation depth to N relationship hops
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
Display compact flat table layout
.TP
<\fIELEMENT_ID\fR>
Target element ID (UUID or prefix) to analyze
